li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><b>Villas: </b><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Spacious homes in a secure, well-planned community, offering privacy, exclusivity, and shared amenities.<br><br></span></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><b>Gated Community Row Houses</b>:<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> Elegant, multi-level homes combining the benefits of independent living with a close-knit community feel.&nbsp;<br></span><br></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><b>Land Plots:</b> <span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Residential plots available for custom-built homes, investment purposes, or future development in prime and emerging locales</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Note:</span>&nbsp;</span>Confused between choosing&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ext-6790324.livejournal.com/688.html\" target=\"_blank\">furnished vs unfurnished 2 BHK apartments</a>&nbsp;for rent? Read this comparison guide to make the smarter decision based on your needs and budget.</p><div><br></div><h3 style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Property Price Trends</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc3nv9przrszhj\",\"id\":\"toc_l17rteygzr94\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_l17rteygzr94\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc3nv9przrszhj\",\"id\":\"toc_l17rteygzr94\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_l17rteygzr94\">&nbsp;</span></b></h3><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">The prices have increased a great deal in the past 5 years. It is due to improved roads, new schools and offices. People adore this area due to growth and rental demand.<br><br></span></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Year</b></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Avg. Price per Sq. Ft.</b></span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Price Growth (%</b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">2020</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹5,000</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">-</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">2022</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹6,500</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">+30%</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span class=\"EOP\">&nbsp;</span>2025</p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">₹9,700</span></p></td><td><p><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">+49%</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b></b></p>",
