      "content": "<p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"3pt\" data-margin-top=\"15pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.5\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000984020\" style=\"margin: 15pt 0px 3pt; line-height: 1.5;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Why Are Prices Rising?</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc53f9obw8i74k\",\"id\":\"toc_o51wq3kk8r1w\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_o51wq3kk8r1w\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc53f9obw8i74k\",\"id\":\"toc_o51wq3kk8r1w\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_o51wq3kk8r1w\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><ul><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">New IT parks and offices.</span></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Top hospitals and schools opening up.</span></li><li style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Metro approaching soon.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Improved roads and flyovers.<br><br></span></li></ul>",
